{
  "name": "accent_states",
  "saveFile": "minimal_colony.rws",
  "comment": "The vanilla-tab twin of nicebilltab_accents: every row state on one screen of vanilla's bills tab. Here the marked order is also next up, which is the co-occurrence BillAccentRule.WashFor exists for — one fill per row, the marker's red, with the accent's blue kept on the edge bar. No forced red: vanilla has no 'nobody can do this' row colour for us to defer to.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "SetTerrain",
      "args": {
        "def": "Concrete",
        "width": "14",
        "height": "10"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "PlaceThings",
      "args": {
        "def": "ElectricStove",
        "layout": "cells",
        "cells": "-3,0; 3,0",
        "rot": "South"
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "The fixture has one free colonist, and three bills have to be in flight at once — one pawn starting a second job would end its first and hand that claim back.",
      "type": "SpawnPawn",
      "args": {
        "kind": "Colonist",
        "faction": "player",
        "count": "2",
        "offset": "-2,-3"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "WbgClaimBenches",
      "args": {
        "def": "ElectricStove"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "WbgLinkBenches",
      "args": {
        "def": "ElectricStove",
        "limit": "2",
        "mode": "InOrder"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Probe",
      "args": {
        "probeName": "wbg_group_size",
        "expectedValue": "2",
        "tolerance": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "WbgAddBill",
      "args": {
        "recipe": "CookMealSimple",
        "count": "5"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "WbgAddBill",
      "args": {
        "recipe": "CookMealFine",
        "count": "5"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "WbgAddBill",
      "args": {
        "recipe": "CookMealSurvival",
        "count": "5"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "WbgAddBill",
      "args": {
        "recipe": "CookMealLavish",
        "count": "3"
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "Marked first, so it is at the head and also next up: the marker and the blue accent land on one row, which is the co-occurrence the wash rule exists for.",
      "type": "WbgMarkNextOrder",
      "args": {
        "slot": "2"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Probe",
      "args": {
        "probeName": "wbg_head_bill_slot",
        "expectedValue": "2",
        "tolerance": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "WbgFocusBench",
      "args": {
        "def": "ElectricStove",
        "index": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "LookAt",
      "args": {
        "zoom": "12"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Wait",
      "args": {
        "frames": "20"
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "First capture of a scenario carries the HUD regardless of hideUi, so this one is spent.",
      "type": "Screenshot",
      "args": {
        "fileName": "accents_warmup.png",
        "hideUi": "false"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Wait",
      "args": {
        "frames": "10"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Screenshot",
      "args": {
        "fileName": "accents_idle.png",
        "hideUi": "false"
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "atBench points the job's targetA at the bench, which is what IsWorkedAt reads. Bench 1 is the one whose tab is open, so this is 'worked here'.",
      "type": "WbgSimulateBillStart",
      "args": {
        "slot": "0",
        "atBench": "1",
        "requireDistinct": "true"
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "Bench 0 is the other member of the group: 'worked at another bench'.",
      "type": "WbgSimulateBillStart",
      "args": {
        "slot": "1",
        "atBench": "0",
        "requireDistinct": "true"
      }
    },
    {
      "comment": "A second bill worked here, so two green rows show that the rule is per bill rather than per bench.",
      "type": "WbgSimulateBillStart",
      "args": {
        "slot": "3",
        "atBench": "1",
        "requireDistinct": "true"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "WbgFocusBench",
      "args": {
        "def": "ElectricStove",
        "index": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Probe",
      "args": {
        "probeName": "wbg_worked_here_slot",
        "expectedValue": "0",
        "tolerance": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Probe",
      "args": {
        "probeName": "wbg_worked_elsewhere_slot",
        "expectedValue": "1",
        "tolerance": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Probe",
      "args": {
        "probeName": "wbg_next_up_slot",
        "expectedValue": "2",
        "tolerance": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Probe",
      "args": {
        "probeName": "wbg_next_order_slot",
        "expectedValue": "2",
        "tolerance": "0"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "LookAt",
      "args": {
        "zoom": "12"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Wait",
      "args": {
        "frames": "20"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "Screenshot",
      "args": {
        "fileName": "accents_states.png",
        "hideUi": "false"
      }
    }
  ]
}
